{%- comment -%}
============================================================================
BLOCK-EMBED-KLAVIYO-BIS
============================================================================
Vertaallaag voor de Klaviyo Back in Stock-popup.

Klaviyo staat maar één BIS-formulier per account toe, in één taal. De
opmaak en teksten blijven in Klaviyo (CWM beheert die zelf); deze section
draagt per taal de vervangteksten en vervangt ze in de browser zodra de
popup verschijnt (simpele find & replace op hele teksten).

FEATURES:
- Klaviyo zet zijn eigen knop op de plek van .klaviyo-bis-trigger
  (html-product-atc); ook die knoptekst gaat via de paren
- Blocks "Klaviyo text → Replacement" (vertaalbaar via Translate & Adapt)
- Vervanging in elke taal (bron = Klaviyo-tekst), alleen op productpagina's
- Strikt afgebakend: alleen de BIS-knop en het BIS-formulier (form ID setting)
- Theme editor: console-melding voor bronteksten die niet gevonden worden

DEV-GATE (tijdelijk):
- Alleen actief met ?dev=klaviyo-bis (blijft hangen per sessie,
  ?dev=off zet uit). Zonder gate blijft de trigger verborgen.
- Gate verwijderen = de {% style %}-regel hieronder + DEV_GATE in de JS.

DEPENDENCIES:
- block-embed-klaviyo-bis.min.js
- snippets/html-product-atc.liquid (trigger .klaviyo-bis-trigger)
- Klaviyo onsite app embed + gepubliceerd BIS-formulier in Klaviyo
============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if template.name == 'product' -%}
	{% style %}
		html:not(.is-dev-klaviyo-bis) .product-atc__notify--klaviyo {
			display: none !important;
		}
	{% endstyle %}

	<script type="application/json" data-klaviyo-bis-config>
		{
			"primary": {{ request.locale.primary | json }},
			"locale": {{ request.locale.iso_code | json }},
			"designMode": {{ request.design_mode | json }},
			"formId": {{ section.settings.form_id | strip | json }},
			"pairs": [
				{%- assign sep = '' -%}
				{%- for block in section.blocks -%}
					{%- if block.type == 'string' and block.settings.title != blank and block.settings.replacement != blank -%}
						{{ sep }}[{{ block.settings.title | json }}, {{ block.settings.replacement | json }}]
						{%- assign sep = ',' -%}
					{%- endif -%}
				{%- endfor -%}
			]
		}
	</script>

	<script src="{{ 'block-embed-klaviyo-bis.min.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
	"name": "Klaviyo back in stock",
	"tag": "div",
	"class": "block-embed-klaviyo-bis",
	"limit": 1,
	"enabled_on": {
		"groups": ["footer"]
	},
	"settings": [
		{
			"type": "header",
			"content": "Klaviyo form"
		},
		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "form_id",
			"label": "Back in stock form ID",
			"info": "Find this in Klaviyo under Forms > Form ID. Replacements only apply inside this form and the back in stock button.",
			"default": "U3fSkF"
		},
		{
			"type": "header",
			"content": "Translations"
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"content": "Add one block per text in the Klaviyo back in stock button and form. 'Klaviyo text' must match exactly what Klaviyo shows (one line per block) — do not translate it. Fill 'Replacement' in the primary language and translate it via Translate & Adapt."
		}
	],
	"blocks": [
		{
			"type": "string",
			"name": "Text replacement",
			"settings": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"id": "title",
					"label": "Klaviyo text",
					"info": "Exactly as shown in the Klaviyo form. Do not translate."
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"id": "replacement",
					"label": "Replacement",
					"info": "Translate this field per language via Translate & Adapt."
				}
			]
		}
	],
	"presets": [
		{
			"name": "Klaviyo back in stock",
			"category": "Embed"
		}
	]
}
{% endschema %}
